# Phase 2 (Part 1): Brand Design System & Lucide Icon Overhaul

We will transform HealSync's visual design system from multi-color gradients and emojis to an executive, single-brand navy palette (#243B63) paired with **Lucide Icons** (`lucide-angular`).

---

## 🎨 1. Core Color System (`src/styles.css`)

We will update CSS variables to reflect the INDmoney-inspired navy brand palette:

| Role | Variable | Hex Color | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Brand Primary Navy** | `--primary-color` / `--brand-navy` | `#243B63` | Headers, active nav, primary buttons, logo |
| **Deep Navy (Dark Header)** | `--deep-navy` | `#1C2B4F` | Top navigation bar / statement headers |
| **Light Card Surface** | `--card-bg-light` | `#F5F5F8` | Subtle card background |
| **Pure White Surface** | `--surface-white` | `#FFFFFF` | Primary content panels |
| **Accent Positive (Success)** | `--accent-green` / `--status-confirmed` | `#00C896` | Confirmed, gains, success badges |
| **Danger Red** | `--accent-red` / `--status-cancelled` | `#EF4444` | Cancelled, rejection, destructive actions |
| **Pending Amber** | `--accent-amber` / `--status-pending` | `#F59E0B` | Pending status |
| **Neutral Text** | `--text-primary` | `#1E293B` | High contrast body text |
| **Muted Text** | `--text-secondary` | `#64748B` | Labels, captions |
| **Icon Standard Color** | `--icon-color` | `#243B63` | Single-color uniform icon stroke |

