## 🛠️ Implementation Steps

### Phase 2.1: Package Installation & Shared Module Setup
1. Run `npm install lucide-angular` inside `doctor-appointment-frontend`.
2. Import `LucideAngularModule` into `SharedModule` / `AppModule` with all required Lucide icons.

### Phase 2.2: Global Design System & CSS Token Overhaul
1. Update `src/styles.css` root CSS variables (`--primary-color: #243B63`, `--brand-navy: #243B63`, `--deep-navy: #1C2B4F`, etc.).
2. Update global header, sidebar, button, card, modal, and badge styles to use `#243B63` solid navy styling.

### Phase 2.3: Logo Recolor
1. Update top nav & auth screen logo badges to solid brand navy (`#243B63`), removing multi-color gradients.

